Subject: 037-add-testrawtxbatch-and-submitrawtxbatch-rpcs: add testrawtxbatch
 and submitrawtxbatch RPCs and V2 package validation

Adds testrawtxbatch (non-mutating batch dry-run) and submitrawtxbatch
(all-or-nothing topological package submission) with V2 parent-child package
validation and co-located unit tests in snapshot_rcu_tests.cpp and
txpackage_tests.cpp.
